The '''Mos Espa City Hall'''<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|mos-espa-city-hall|Mos Espa City Hall}}</ref> was located in the [[Mos Espa city center|city center]] of [[Mos Espa]], a [[city]] located on the [[planet]] [[Tatooine]], during the [[New Republic Era]]. The office of the [[Mayor of Mos Espa]], [[Mok Shaiz]], was located in the city hall.<ref name="The Tribes of Tatooine" /> It was designed by noted [[Tynnan]] [[architect]] [[Pisc Dowdrena]].<ref name="CLNE">''[[Star Wars: Complete Locations, New Edition]]''</ref>
